  "label": "child is the one who will wait here",
  "description": "The text 'i'll just wait here' is mapped onto the visual entity 'child'. The child's pensive, resigned expression and passive posture (hands under chin) are used as an analogical representation of the human behavior of choosing to wait rather than engage further. This mapping is central to the meme's humor and intent, where the child's innocent demeanor is projected onto the concept of passive resignation.",
